                Add <code class="cu-code">cu-table-actions</code> to a cell for hover-revealed row actions. Add <code class="cu-code">group</code> to the <code class="cu-code">cu-table-row</code> to enable the hover effect.
            </p>
            <ComponentPreview code={withRowActionsCode}>
                <div class="w-full max-w-2xl">
